1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:06,472
Good news! Corporate sent
a self-checkout. It never sleeps.
It never smiles.

2
00:00:06,512 --> 00:00:08,026
Neither do I.

3
00:00:08,066 --> 00:00:10,122
It does it for less.

4
00:00:10,162 --> 00:00:12,416
I'm naming him Kevin!

5
00:00:13,786 --> 00:00:17,163
Unexpected item in bagging area.

6
00:00:17,383 --> 00:00:20,995
Please place item in bagging area.

7
00:00:21,315 --> 00:00:24,601
Unexpected item in bagging area.

8
00:00:24,641 --> 00:00:26,775
He's doing his best!

9
00:00:26,815 --> 00:00:30,976
Assistance required.
Assistance required.

10
00:00:32,746 --> 00:00:34,730
Assistance provided.

11
00:00:34,770 --> 00:00:36,826
No! Kevin!

12
00:00:36,866 --> 00:00:39,512
Noted. Rae stays.
